       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The Visionaire Configuration Tool was made as a little helper for technical issues many years ago. Most of the settings are handled ingame or by the engine itself now. As the tool is not needed anymore for daily use, we decided to remove the tool from the starting options and just keep it in the local game files.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
